    "article_summary": "This article describes the development of a fully heterogeneous dual catalytic system using single Ni atoms supported on carbon nitride (NiSAC/CN) for visible-light-driven C-N coupling. The system demonstrates high activity and stability compared to semi-heterogeneous counterparts, with mechanistic studies revealing a Ni(0)/Ni(II)/Ni(III)/Ni(I) redox cycle facilitated by metal-support interactions.",
